<BaseLayout title="Open Source | Strix Engineering Studio" description="Explore open-source engineering work and tools from Strix Engineering Studio." canonical="/open-source/">
<section class="section-space"><div class="strix-container space-y-10"><header class="max-w-4xl space-y-5 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="editorial-meta text-primary">Open source</p><h1 class="editorial-serif type-display-lg">Engineering work, shared in the open.</h1><p class="body-large max-w-3xl text-muted-foreground">Strix publishes selected reusable tools, experiments, and engineering resources through its GitHub organization.</p></header><div class="border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-9"><p class="editorial-meta text-primary">GitHub organization</p><h2 class="editorial-serif mt-3 text-3xl">Strix Engineering Studio</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Explore public repositories, review implementation details, and follow projects as they become available.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex border border-primary bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground" href="https://github.com/strix-engineering-studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore repositories ↗</a></div></div></section>
